window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Angels were only in fairytales—or so Talia Lin believed until her best friend revealed the truth about magic and Supernaturals. Now gifted with Elemental powers, Talia hides her human identity at Fera College of Magic, where danger lurks for someone like her.</p> <p>When Talia crosses paths with Orja Martin, an Angel she met a few years ago, their connection reignites. But Orja, haunted by tragedy and guilt, is determined to keep his distance. His unstable powers and painful past make him unwilling to embrace the unbreakable bond Angel Mates are said to share.</p> <p>As Talia’s secret comes to light and a deadly plot threatens the Supernatural world, she and Orja must decide if their connection is strong enough to face the ultimate sacrifice.</p>"; 
